bocl tries to open a rc-file.
But looks like the RC file name is empty.

It should be one of:

~/.bocl
~/.bocl.lisp
~/.config/bocl/init
~/.config/bocl/init.lisp
~/.common-lisp
~/.common-lisp.lisp
~/.config/common-lisp/init
~/.config/common-lisp/init.lisp

The first file present should be loaded, unless one of the following
options is given:

    -n|-norc|--no-init

If the  -i|--init FILE  option is given then the init files are loaded
in order (several -i options can be given), after the RC file.


